{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/援护敕令","pageid":6638,"revid":15035,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%8F%B4%E6%8A%A4%E6%95%95%E4%BB%A4&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%8F%B4%E6%8A%A4%E6%95%95%E4%BB%A4&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%8F%B4%E6%8A%A4%E6%95%95%E4%BB%A4&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>援护敕令</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E6.8F.B4.E6.8A.A4.E6.95.95.E4.BB.A4\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"援护敕令\"><b>援护敕令</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 援护敕令.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/1e/pbyimsib8jjgm0qlzrz9r3fuecz2d98.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%8F%B4%E6%8A%A4%E6%95%95%E4%BB%A4.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/1e/pbyimsib8jjgm0qlzrz9r3fuecz2d98.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%8F%B4%E6%8A%A4%E6%95%95%E4%BB%A4.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/1e/pbyimsib8jjgm0qlzrz9r3fuecz2d98.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />援护敕令\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>6\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓8-↑8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（支援）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放枷锁\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放枷锁</font></span></span>]，使自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">6</font>格内所有已方（非召唤角色）获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲物防2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲物防2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲魔防2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲魔防2</font></span></span>]；对范围内敌人施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼攻击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼攻击2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">▼暴击3</font></span>]、<font color=\"#ed7950\">12</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"粉碎枷锁\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">粉碎枷锁</font></span></span>]；使自身获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"免伤2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">免伤2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"偏斜\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">偏斜</font></span></span>]，所有效果持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回台。若拥有下述[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]层数，则消耗对应层数并触发效果：拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">10</font>层时，在范围内最近的<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>名友军（非召唤角色）使其获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"免伤2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">免伤2</font></span></span>]及[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"偏斜\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">偏斜</font></span></span>](持续2回合)，及在其周围召唤1名[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"帝国不朽军\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">帝国不朽军</font></span></span>]，并使[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"帝国不朽军\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">帝国不朽军</font></span></span>]获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"周全护卫\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">周全护卫</font></span></span>]，若没有友军目标，则在自身周围召唤。拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">20</font>层时，效果更改为：在范围内最近的<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>名友军（非召唤角色）召唤，并获得对应效果。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-0 6.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/aa/bmo6a0hv1uysms0211s38co3omb4kus.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-0_6.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/aa/bmo6a0hv1uysms0211s38co3omb4kus.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%9F%BA%E5%AE%89%E5%B8%8C%E5%B0%94\" title=\"角色图鉴库/基安希尔\"><img alt=\"头像 基安希尔.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/61/fl81fezqdtxw1h6zsryxqmfwsjh16v8.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">基安希尔</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div st